@startuml
title MDR-D05 Fiscal Visibility Projection and Exception Handoff
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Management Dashboard\nFiscal Widgets" as Dashboard
component "Central PMS Fiscal\nRead Model / Projection" as FiscalReadModel
component "Central PMS Fiscal\nIssuance References" as FiscalRefs
component "POS Server Fiscal Evidence\nrecorded by Central PMS" as PosEvidence
component "Fiscal Exception Backlog\nprojection" as Backlog
component "Future Fiscal Exception Queue\nretry/readback/writeback/closure owner" as Queue
component "Management Dashboard\naggregate trends/SLA indicators" as Trends

Dashboard --> FiscalReadModel : read fiscal status,\nage, backlog
FiscalReadModel --> FiscalRefs : primary platform source
FiscalReadModel --> PosEvidence : only after Central PMS\nrecords POS Server evidence
FiscalReadModel --> Backlog
Backlog --> Queue : navigation/handoff only
Dashboard --> Trends : success rate, pending age,\nfailed/unknown counts

Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> Queue : no retry, readback,\nwriteback, or closure
Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> PosEvidence : no direct POS Server call
Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> FiscalRefs : no direct fiscal\nstate mutation

note bottom
Dashboard fiscal visibility is projection/read-model only.
Fiscal recovery mechanics belong to the later Fiscal Exception Queue / Readback / Retry design.
end note
@enduml
